{"id": "DGKXAupPL4P", "title": "Video by visionmachina", "description": "Why do people wear Nike? Because it’s cool? Because of culture? Peer pressure, maybe?\n\nThis Wes Anderson-style ad explores the undeniable, almost hypnotic influence of the swoosh—Nike’s iconic checkmark. With symmetrical shots, deadpan delivery, and an absurdly honest script, Always the Swoosh pokes fun at the fact that, deep down, we all know the real reason: the swoosh just hits different.\n\n🔹 Concept & Style\nInspired by Wes Anderson’s signature filmmaking, this ad features:\n✅ Perfectly framed, center-aligned shots (because symmetry is everything)\n✅ Quirky, dry humor (yes, we’re calling you out)\n✅ Deadpan narration & abrupt cuts (because life is awkward, and so is this ad)\n✅ A bold, undeniable truth—it’s always about the swoosh\n\nIf you love Nike, Wes Anderson films, or just enjoy a bit of satire in advertising, this one’s for you.\n\n💬 Comment below: Why do you wear Nike?\n📌 Tag a friend who’s guilty of swoosh obsession!\n👍 Like for more creative takes on culture, branding, and filmmaking.\n\nBackground Music from Epidemic Sound\n\nWant to collaborate on cinematic projects? Let’s talk! 📩 donavan@visionmachina.com", "channel": "visionmachina", "uploader_id": "71483437226", "uploader": "VISION MACHINA", "timestamp": 1739769647, "like_count": 27, "comment_count": 5, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1336450974149581a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 57.259, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQMSKDegm3VU04eIx1o2O3kKMFINVvZODonuJuXpaBmrOQWCT499xdKRQahAByWXSBqWXsYIqmyH9yTdtrl3bXzs.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_oc=Adp01PA4fWHDZn4fA8BGwu3kp9W-8AlFZ7JVN3W8sfm6SSuP1_mtr9nxZqqs7b3tphyORL1ZB6MKY-HCKRrX63K0&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=o2U0IuwfpJYQ7kNvwFskQJ9&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=Uomz8H